{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45375","headline":"张伯英草书歌 · 皎然","name":"张伯英草书歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"伯英死後生怕高，朝看手把山中毫。\n先贤草律我草狂，风云阵发愁锺王。\n须臾变态皆自我，象形类物无不可。\n阆风游云千万朵，惊龙蹴踏飞欲堕。\n更覩邓林花落朝，狂风乱搅何飘飘。\n有时凝然笔空握，情在寥天独飞鹤。\n有时取势气更高，忆得春江千里涛。\n张生奇绝难再遇，草罢临风展轻素。\n阴惨阳舒如有道，鬼状魑容若可惧。\n黄公酒垆兴偏入，阮籍不嗔嵇亦顾。\n长安酒牓醉後书，此日骋君千里步。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}